# @GAME_TITLE@

Generated with `scripts/new-game.sh @GAME_NAME@` (template `window`).

```bash
cmake --preset dev                                   # once, or after adding files
cmake --build --preset dev --target run-@GAME_NAME@  # build + run
ctest --preset dev -R @GAME_NAME@                    # smoke test (30 frames, offscreen)
```

`@GAME_CLASS@.cpp` shows the engine basics: modules, input actions, an ECS entity updated in the
fixed step, and logging. Esc quits; hold Space to speed up. See `docs/FIRST_GAME.md`.
